  "sourceTitle": "Meat Croquettes",
  "sourceText": "Meat Croquettes\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 18, 2009 - 12:26am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups Cooked ground meat\nSalt and pepper\n2 tablespoons Water\n1 cup Thick white sauce\nCelery salt\n1 Egg, slightly beaten\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine meat and white sauce. Season to taste. Mix thoroughly. Cool. Form in balls, cones, or cylinders. Roll in crumbs. Fry in deep fat (385F) until brown. Drain on crumpled absorbent paper. 8 servings.",
